      en: ["Construction of the castle began around 1227 under the Kyburg dynasty.", "The massive square tower measures approximately 13 by 13 meters.", "The Swiss Confederates seized the castle and the surrounding land in 1460.", "For nearly 300 years, it was the administrative heart of the Thurgau region.", "The Historical Museum within the castle was inaugurated in the year 1960.", "The St. Anna Chapel, added in the late Middle Ages, contains historic gothic elements."],
