      en: ["Castels was the largest and most important seat of power in the Prättigau valley.", "In 1649, the locals demolished the castle with their own hands.", "The complex is located on a rocky ridge approximately 100 meters long.", "Parts of the curtain wall still exhibit a considerable height today.", "The castle was a central site of the Prättigau uprising against Austria.", "A comprehensive renovation of the ruins took place between 1999 and 2004."],
      es: ["Construido en el siglo XII", "Altura de la torre: aprox. 18 m", "Planta cuadrada con una longitud lateral de 8 m", "Destrucción en el siglo XV", "Hallazgos: monedas y cerámica medievales", "Monumento cultural protegido"],
      pt: ["Construído no século XII", "Altura da torre: aprox. 18 m", "Planta quadrada com um lado de 8 m", "Destruição no século XV", "Achados: moedas e cerâmica medievais", "Monumento cultural protegido"],
      fr: ["Construit au XIIe siècle", "Hauteur du donjon : env. 18 m", "Plan carré avec un côté de 8 m", "Destruction au XVe siècle", "Découvertes : pièces de monnaie et poteries médiévales", "Monument culturel protégé"],
